23:05.640 --> 23:06.960
A... ada apa ini?

23:07.070 --> 23:07.870
Pusing.

23:08.340 --> 23:09.100
Pusing.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.220
Apa karena gula darah rendah?

23:09.260 --> 23:10.510
